[en.CHARACTER_AURORA_NAME]
Aurora

[en.CHARACTER_AURORA_DESC]
Remember importance of our traditions, they hold the pain and joy thousands of year.
When we connect to the past, the spirits speak, and it tells us how to survive.

[zh.CHARACTER_AURORA_NAME]
奥罗拉

[zh.CHARACTER_AURORA_DESC]
记住我们传统的重要性，它们承载了数千年的痛苦和欢乐。
当我们与过去联系时，精灵们会说话，它们告诉我们如何生存。
